@base = http://127.0.0.1:43111

### OpenAPI document
GET {{base}}/openapi/v1.json

### First page
GET {{base}}/api/inspections?page=1&pageSize=1

### NG filter
GET {{base}}/api/inspections?station=station-a&result=NG

### Cursor page, pass nextCursor as after on the next request
GET {{base}}/api/inspection-pages?station=station-a&result=NG&pageSize=1

### CSV for the entire filtered result
GET {{base}}/api/inspections?result=NG&format=csv

### Invalid page, expect 400 and requestId
GET {{base}}/api/inspections?page=0

### Unknown cycle, expect 404 and requestId
GET {{base}}/api/inspections/missing

### Requires --Events:Enabled true; resume using nextAfter
GET {{base}}/api/inspection-events?after=0&limit=1

### Process liveness
GET {{base}}/health/live

### Inspection query readiness
GET {{base}}/health/ready
